// Food drains and the pack's food restores it: a hungry Delver eats a grub, then the roots. Digging a
// root tangle turns up edible roots.
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#...........tttttttttt.......#
#...........tttttttttt.......#
#...........tttttttttt.......#
#...........tttttttttt.......#
#...........tttttttttt.......#
#...........tttttttttt.......#
#...@.......tttttttttt.......#
##############################
end
mode survival
// hunger drains over time (about 0.33 a second)
set 1 hunger 80
expect 600 hunger < 77
// below 40 the mole eats (every second tick): a grub first, then roots
set 610 hunger 39
expect 615 inv:Grub == 2
expect 615 hunger > 80
set 620 hunger 39
set 625 hunger 39
expect 632 inv:Grub == 0
set 640 hunger 39
expect 645 inv:Root == 1
// starving hurts
set 700 hunger 0
expect 760 hp < 100
// dig into the root tangle: roots come out with the wood
tool 800 1
mine 800-1000 10 -2
mine 1000-1200 10 -5
expect 1200 inv:Wood > 0
expect 1200 inv:Root > 1
